%% Sequence Diagram — Delete Patient (permanent) — Logical level
%% Updated: 2026-06-15 — aligned to the implementation: an existence check
%% followed by a permanent delete, with no archive branch.
%% Lifelines = logical components, messages = business actions.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Admin
    participant V as Patient list (Client)
    participant API as Patient API (Server)
    participant BIZ as Patient business rules
    participant STORE as Patient storage

    A->>V: Click "Delete" on a patient
    V->>A: Show confirmation dialog
    A->>V: Confirm
    V->>API: Request delete patient
    API->>BIZ: Delete patient
    BIZ->>STORE: Check that this patient exists
    STORE-->>BIZ: Exists or not

    alt Patient not found
        BIZ-->>API: Not found
        API-->>V: Not found response
        V-->>A: Show error message
    else Patient exists
        BIZ->>STORE: Remove the patient permanently
        Note over STORE: The patient's linked medical records<br/>are removed together
        BIZ-->>API: Permanently deleted
        API-->>V: Success
        V-->>A: Notify and refresh list
    end
